	measure 'Forecasted Sales M1' = ```
			
			    VAR AvgSales = [Monthly Average Sales for 6 month period]
			    VAR Growth = SELECTEDVALUE('Dim_Product'[GrowthFactor], 1)
			RETURN
			    (AvgSales * (1 + (Growth/100)))
			```
		lineageTag: 2acf7e7b-a214-45e4-9d36-e7f0808036cf

